msgid "Model identifier from **constructor**, validated during decoding."
msgstr "Model identifier from **constructor**, validated during decoding."

msgid "Unsigned integer width in bytes (1, 2, 4, 8) or VarUInt."
msgstr "Unsigned integer width in bytes (1, 2, 4, 8) or VarUInt."

msgid ""
"The int type is validated when building the schema; the value range is validated during encoding."
" Nested models skip this element."
msgstr ""
"The int type is validated when building the schema; the value range is validated during encoding."
" Nested models skip this element."

msgid "The size of all encoded fields, excluding the entire header."
msgstr "Размер всех закодированных полей, исключая весь header."

msgid "The unsigned integer width in bytes (1, 2, 4, 8), or VarUInt."
msgstr "Ширина unsigned integer в байтах (1, 2, 4, 8) или VarUInt."

msgid ""
"When reading, bounds the field buffer by the declared length. The position of this element within"
" the header does not change the meaning of the stored number."
msgstr ""
"При чтении ограничивает буфер полей объявленной длиной. Позиция этого элемента внутри header не "
"меняет смысл записанного числа."

msgid "A bitmap indicating the presence of optional fields, computed from their values."
msgstr "Bitmap присутствия optional-полей, вычисляемый из их значений."

msgid ""
"A field is present if its value is not None. Bit numbers are set using field(flag=...) and are "
"limited to 0–63; with a fixed width, all used bits are checked to ensure they fit."
msgstr ""
"Поле присутствует, если его значение не None. Номера битов задаются через field(flag=...) и "
"ограничены 0–63; при фиксированной ширине проверяется, что все используемые биты в неё "
"помещаются."

